        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "=Hi {{ $json.candidate_name }},\n\nYour application has been processed successfully.\n\nApplication ID: {{ $json.application_id }}\nCompany: {{ $json.company }}\nPosition: {{ $json.job_title }}\nCV Fit Score: {{ $json.fit_score }}/100\nEvidence Confidence: {{ $json.confidence }}/100\n\nSUMMARY\n{{ $json.fit_summary }}\n\nMATCHING SKILLS\n{{ $json.matching_skills }}\n\nGAPS TO ADDRESS\n{{ $json.missing_skills }}\n\nHOW THE SCORE WAS CALCULATED\n{{ $json.reasoning }}\n\n----------------------------------------\nYOUR PERSONALISED COVER LETTER\n----------------------------------------\n\n{{ $json.cover_letter }}\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nThis application has been logged and a follow-up reminder has been added to the calendar for {{ DateTime.fromISO($json.follow_up_date).toFormat('dd LLL yyyy') }}.\n\nBest regards,\nJob Application Autopilot",
